ive" aria-label="Notifications" data-state="closed" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_212t_"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--bell] h-4 w-4 origin-[50%_2px]"></span></button></div><button type="button" class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 motion-reduce:transition-none size-8 border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.03] text-muted-foreground hover:bg-white/[0.07] hover:text-foreground active:bg-white/[0.05]" aria-label="Options" data-state="closed" id="radix-_r_2133_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--ellipsis] size-4"></span></button></div></div></div></header></div><div class="relative flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1"><div class="h-full min-w-0 shrink-0 overflow-hidden" style="width: 15%;"><div class="relative flex flex-col h-full"><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col"><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col"><div class="flex min-h-0 min-w-0 flex-1" style="height: 100%;"><div data-testid="virtuoso-scroller" data-virtuoso-scroller="true" tabindex="0" class="min-h-0 flex-1 md:scroll-fade-t overscroll-contain scrollbar-autohide" data-virtualized-message-scroller="true" style="height: 100%; outline: none; overflow-y: auto; position: relative;"><div data-viewport-type="element" style="height: 100%; position: absolute; top: 0px; width: 100%;"><div><div class="px-4 pt-2"></div></div><div data-testid="virtuoso-item-list" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 709px;"><div data-index="3" data-item-index="1000003" data-known-size="8607" style="overflow-anchor: none;"><div class="px-4 pb-1"><div class="group flex text-sm flex-col gap-1 py-2"><div class="flex flex-row items-center text-sm font-bold gap-1"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#000000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-3"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg>Rork</div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" aria-controls="_r_2150_" aria-expanded="false"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Thought for 3s</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>You got it — <strong>Kotlin + Jetpack Compose</strong> it is. I'll build SafeCell AI as a native Android app with Material 3, one shared design system, and all 7 screens. Let me scaffold the project first.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>You explicitly asked for Jetpack Compose — that's clear Android intent. Retrying with Kotlin.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" aria-controls="_r_2151_" aria-expanded="false"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Thought for 1s</span></button></div><div><div class="flex flex-col py-0.5"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-muted-foreground animate-in fade-in-0 duration-300 motion-reduce:animate-none"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--check] size-3 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground"></span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">13 of 13 to-dos completed</span></div></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 8 files</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Good — clean scaffold. Let me start building. First, I'll download the Poppins font files and set up the theme.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Now let me build the theme with our SafeCell color palette and Poppins typography.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 3 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Now I'll generate the hero car image while I build the shared widgets. Let me kick off the asset generation and start coding in parallel.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 1 file</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Let me generate the hero car image and other visual assets in the background while I build the code.</p></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div dir="ltr" data-testid="image-gen-row-scroll-area" class="relative w-full overflow-hidden" style="position: relative; --radix-scroll-area-corner-width: 0px; --radix-scroll-area-corner-height: 0px;"><style>[data-radix-scroll-area-viewport]{scrollbar-width:none;-ms-overflow-style:none;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}[data-radix-scroll-area-viewport]::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}</style><div data-radix-scroll-area-viewport="" data-testid="image-gen-row" class="w-full rounded-[inherit] safari-scroll-area-module__YjPaha__radixViewportTableFix" style="overflow: scroll hidden;"><div style="min-width: 100%; display: table;"><div data-testid="image-gen-row-content" class="flex pb-4 gap-3 pr-1"><div class="shrink-0"><div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-muted/20 border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5" style="width: 200px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--image-off] size-6 text-muted-foreground/40"></span><span class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground/60 font-medium">Asset removed</span></div></div><div class="shrink-0"><div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-muted/20 border border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5" style="width: 200px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--image-off] size-6 text-muted-foreground/40"></span><span clas