word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>All 5 hero assets generated successfully. Let me build all 7 screens now. First, a constants file for asset URLs, then all screens in parallel.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Now let me build all 7 screens. I'll start with Home and Gas Monitoring.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 4 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Let me continue building the remaining screens. I'll clean up EmergencyScreen and build Fire Suppression, Settings, ESP32, and Maps screens.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 6 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Now let me wire up the navigation with a bottom nav bar and update the main activity.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Let me update the theme to force light mode (since the spec calls for a light gray background) and run the build check.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 6 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>I see the compilation errors. Let me fix them systematically:</p><ol class="list-decimal pl-6 my-2"><li>Poppins not imported in screen files</li><li>HeroGradientHeader trailing lambda doesn't work (not last param)</li><li>Triple can't hold 4 args (enabled flag)</li><li>BottomSheetPanel parameter order needs statCards last for trailing lambda</li><li>Missing size import in navigation</li></ol><p>Let me fix the shared widgets first, then all screens.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 1 file</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Let me fix all the compilation errors. The main issues are: <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">HeroGradientHeader</span> needs <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">heroContent</span> as last param for trailing lambda, <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">BottomSheetPanel</span> needs <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">statCards</span> last, <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">CircularIconRow</span> needs a data class instead of <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Triple</span> (for the <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">enabled</span> flag), and <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Poppins</span> import is missing in screens.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 1 file</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>I need to fix several structural issues: trailing lambda parameter ordering, the <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Triple</span> limitation for 4 args, and missing imports. Let me fix the shared widgets first, then all screens.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Now I need to update all screen files to match the new widget signatures. Let me fix them all.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 6 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Let me fix the ESP32 screen with proper imports, then fix Maps and Settings screens, then the navigation.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 3 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Now let me also fix the Settings screen (needs <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Poppins</span> import) and run the build check.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 2 files</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Settings screen already has <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Poppins</span> imported. Let me run the build check now.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored errors</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>I see the issues. Let me fix them systematically:</p><ol class="list-decimal pl-6 my-2"><li>CircularAction needs onClick as the last param for trailing lambda syntax</li><li>Poppins might not be resolving from Theme.kt — I'll move it to Color.kt where SafeCellTypography lives</li><li>Missing size import in AppNavigation.kt</li></ol></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>I see the root issues. The <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Poppins</span> val was lost when I rewrote <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Theme.kt</span> (it was in the first version but not the second), and <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">AppNavigation.kt</span> is missing the <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">size</span> import. Let me fix everything.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 2 files</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>I see the issues — <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Poppins</span> font family definition was lost when I rewrote <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Theme.kt</span>, and <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">AppNavigation.kt</span> is missing the <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">size</span> import. Let me fix both and verify the <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">CircularAction</span> order.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 2 searches</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Found it — <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Poppins</span> font family definition was lost. Let me add it back to <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Color.kt</span> and fix the <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">AppNavigation.kt</span> missing import.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 3 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>The <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">size</span> import path is wrong — it should be from <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">androidx.compose.foundation.layout</span>, not <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">androidx.compose.ui.layout</span>. Let me verify the current state of the files and fix all remaining issues.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 6 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Good progress — down to 5 errors. Let me fix them all:</p><ol class="list-decimal pl-6 my-2"><li>SafeCellColors missing from Theme.kt</li><li>AutoRenew icon doesn't exist — need Refresh</li><li>Alignment vs Alignment.Vertical in FireSuppression</li><li>weight missing import in MapsScreen</li><li>MapsScreen Row candidate issue</li></ol></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 7 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Let me fix the remaining errors: duplicate <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">fillMaxWidth</span> import in MapsScreen, <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">weight</span> not available in <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">ToggleChip</span>, and <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Alignment</span> issue in FireSuppression.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 1 file</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Let me fix the duplicate import and the remaining issues.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Let me fix the remaining 3 errors: <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">weight</span> in <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">ToggleChip</span>, <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Alignment</span> in FireSuppression toggle, and <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Surface</span> candidate in MapsScreen.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 3 files</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>I see the three remaining issues. Let me fix them:</p><ol class="list-decimal pl-6 my-2"><li>ToggleChip: Modifier.weight() only works inside RowScope — need to pass it from the caller</li><li>Surface in MapsScreen: Need tonalElevation parameter for the overload with shadowElevation</li><li>Alignment in FireSuppression: .align() isn't available inside Surface content — need a Box wrapper</li></ol></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>I need to add the missing <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">RowScope</span> import to MapsScreen and <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">fillMaxSize</span> import to FireSuppressionScreen.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Explored 2 searches</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Need to add <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">RowScope</span> import to MapsScreen.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 3 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>One error left — the <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">Surface</span> overload in MapsScreen. Let me check the exact line.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 3 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>The issue is mixing <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">top</span> with <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">horizontal</span> in <span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">padding()</span>. Let me fix it.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p>Build succeeded. Now let me generate the app icon and mark the remaining tasks complete.</p></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Made 2 actions</span></button></div><div class="flex min-w-0"><div class="py-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-muted-foreground text-xs min-w-0"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--image] size-3 shrink-0"></span><span class="shrink-0">Generated app icon</span></div></div><div class="flex justify-start w-full mt-1"><div class="w-full max-w-[320px]"><div class="flex items-center justify-center relative max-w-full h-auto mb-4" style="aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;"><img alt="Generated icon" class="relative overflow-hidden w-full aspect-square shadow-md object-cover ios-icon" src="./poppins_medium_files/e3181fbc-5f25-4c7d-9dd8-5db5b947c9da.png"></div></div></div><div class="text-xs"><button type="button" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 py-0.5 text-left text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground" aria-controls="_r_216b_" aria-expanded="false"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90"></span><span class="font-medium">Thought for 1s</span></button></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap"><p><strong>SafeCell AI is built and the build passes.</strong> Here's what I delivered:</p><p><strong>Design system</strong> (<span class="rounded bg-muted-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground">SafeCellWidgets.kt</span>) — one reusable file imported by every screen:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 my-2"><li>HeroGradientHeader — gradient top zone with title, notification bell, pill selector, and animated hero subject (scale + fade in)</li><li>CircularIconButton / CircularIconRow — 3 circular quick-action buttons with spring scale-down on press</li><li>BottomSheetPanel — white rounded-top draggable card with drag handle, headline + colored value, animated progress bar, caption row, and stat cards (slides up on load)</li><li>StatCard / StatCardPair — paired label + icon + bold value cards</li><li>SliderRow — minus/gradient track/plus with draggable thumb</li><li>SettingsRow / SettingsCard / SectionHeader — list-style rows with chevron, switch, or value trailing elements + monospace copy-to-clipboard for MAC addresses</li><li>AnimatedProgressBar — animates from 0 to target</li><li>CountUpText — counts up from 0 on load</li></ul><p><strong>7 screens</strong> (all scrollable, bottom nav pinned):</p><ol class="list-decimal pl-6 my-2"><li>Home — hero car render, "SafeCell X1 &gt;" pill, Lock/Climate/Diagnostics icons, Battery Health 98% green, Cycle Count 342 + Battery Temp 31°C</li><li>Gas Monitoring — cabin sensor diagram hero, "Cabin Sensors &gt;" pill, Refresh/Sensor Log/Calibrate icons, Air Quality "Good" green, CO₂ 412 ppm + Smoke 0.02 mg/m³</li><li>Emergency — neutral gray hero (shifts red when alert active), Call 911/Notify/Cancel (disabled when no alert), "All Systems Normal" green, Battery Temp + Flame Sensor stat cards</li><li>Fire Suppression — suppression nozzle diagram hero, Arm/Test/Log icons, tappable armed/disarmed toggle header, sensitivity slider, Agent Remaining 94% + Last Test 3 days ago</li><li>Settings — profile card with avatar + Edit Profile pill, grouped sections (Notifications, Units, Connected Devices with monospace MAC + copy icon, App), red logout button</li><li>ESP32 Connection — chip illustration hero, Scan/Pair/Forget icons, "Connected" green, signal strength bar, MAC address row, Last Synced "Just now" + Firmware v2.3.1</li><li>Maps — full-bleed map hero with floating translucent title bar, Fire Station/Hospital toggle, ETA progress bar, "2.4 km away — 6 min drive", Current Speed + Coordinates stat cards</li></ol><p><strong>Theme</strong>: Poppins font family bundled (Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold), custom color palette (mint green #00C853, alert red #E0473E, soft gray #F5F6F8, near-black #17181A), 7-tab bottom navigation bar with mint green selection.</p><p><strong>Assets</strong>: 5 AI-generated images (hero car, ESP32 chip, cabin sensor diagram, suppression diagram, map placeholder) + a custom app icon with a shield + lightning bolt motif.</p><p>Everything is local mock state — no network calls, no backend, no real AI. The app is ready to preview in the Android simulator.</p></div></div><div class="pb-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/8 bg-white/3 text-sm transition-colors hover:bg-white/5 motion-reduce:transition-none"><button type="button" aria-label="Open Creation of the SafeCell AI mobile app interface. preview" class="absolute inset-0 z-10 cursor-pointer rounded-xl focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring"></button><div class="pointer-events-none relative z-20 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3.5 pt-2.5 pb-2.5"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-medium tracking-tight">Creation of the SafeCell AI mobile app interface.</h3></div><div class="pointer-events-none relative z-20 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 px-3.5 pb-2.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="pointer-events-auto cursor-pointer rounded-md bg-white/6 px-1.5 py-0.5 transition-colors hover:text-foreground motion-reduce:transition-none">.gitignore</button><button type="button" class="pointer-events-auto cursor-pointer rounded-md bg-white/6 px-1.5 py-0.5 transition-colors hover:text-foreground motion-reduce:transition-none">build.gradle.kts</button><button type="button" class="pointer-events-auto cursor-pointer rounded-md bg-white/6 px-1.5 py-0.5 transition-colors hover:text-foreground motion-reduce:transition-none">AndroidManifest.xml</button><button type="button" class="pointer-events-auto ml-0.5 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:text-foreground motion-reduce:transition-none">+32 more</button></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="-ml-0.5 flex items-center gap-0.5 text-muted-foreground"><span class="inline-flex" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:bg-foreground/10 hover:text-foreground disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 motion-reduce:transition-none"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--undo-2] size-3"></span>Undo</button></span><button type="button" title="Copy response" aria-label="Copy response" class="inline-flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-muted-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:bg-foreground/10 hover:text-foreground motion-reduce:transition-none"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--copy] size-3"></span></button><button type="button" aria-label="Message details" class="inline-flex size-[22px] items-center justify-center rounded-md text-muted-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:bg-foreground/10 hover:text-foreground motion-reduce:transition-none" id="radix-_r_216d_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-[lucide--ellipsis] size-3.5"></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="px-4 pb-8"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="composer-banner-stack" class="mb-2